{"kind": "mod", "id": 1774, "name": "RCTA - Callisto Standard, Deluge [CODMW3]", "slug": "rcta-callisto-standard-deluge-codmw3", "teaser": "Callisto Standard and Deluge Operator Outfits from Call of Duty : Modern Warfare 3 (2023)", "owner_name": "WUVGAWORE", "downloads": 3708, "favourites": 3, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "Creative Commons BY-NC-ND 3.0", "guid": "com.rcta.callisto", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Clothing", "category_id": 14, "updated_at": "2026-08-08T18:03:40.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-10-18T16:37:51.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-10-18T16:37:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "1.0.4", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/3.0/legalcode", "description_html": "<h3>**RCTA - Callisto Standard, Deluge [CODMW3]</h3>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/U2ONOpy.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/U2ONOpy.gif\" alt=\"U2ONOpy.gif\" /></a>**</p>\n<p><strong>Mod Description</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>I was considering porting ALL operator skins for Callisto but most have too much gear on, maybe at a later date I’ll look into it. Hope you enjoy! Sorry about the darker textures on some materials, it’s a cod thing. The “empty” head by the way is for wearing any head-gear to prevent clipping!</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Mod Includes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RCTA Callisto Standard [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Callisto Standard [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Callisto Deluge [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Callisto Deluge [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Callisto Standard [Head] (BEAR/USEC)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Snake Standard Empty [Head] (BEAR/USEC)</strong